 delve deeper into the labyrinth.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/e1e8e2af35f340852c7fb2bf50f92887.avif?t=1760577537\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/8f3d21ba0bf0dba22c6554be702e7d55.avif?t=1760577537\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Novalis, a powerful summoned being who helps Neffy by manipulating gigantic mechanisms and unlocking sealed paths with the power of moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/b17d4f7d63f03ba5f0894345a2af1439.avif?t=1760577537\" width=1024 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Neffy to support her: transforming her into a cat, healing her, or triggering adorable reactions.<br>Neffy is fully voiced by Shiori Izawa (English version: Diana Garnet), adding warmth and personality to every encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Connect with Neffy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.poster.avif?t=1760577537\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.webm?t=1760577537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801500/extras/ec586fc338754f67c57842951b97261d.mp4?t=1760577